<!-- ========== ABOUT: PURPOSE / MISSION / PHILOSOPHY ========== -->
<section id="about" class="tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Who we are</p>
      <h2>Our purpose, mission &amp; <em>philosophy</em></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid g3c">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Our Purpose</span>
        <p>Our purpose is to minister to the children and families of our congregation and the surrounding community. We are a multicultural, multi-ethnic preschool community that will contribute to the quality of the children's lives through age appropriate activities, relationships, and daily experiences within the context of God's love and purpose.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Our Mission</span>
        <p>We provide age-appropriate educational programs that will encourage each child to grow spiritually, mentally, physically and socially in a loving and caring environment.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Our Educational Philosophy</span>
        <p>Children are instructed in the basic concepts of Christian belief and conduct, without a denominational slant. Our teachers are expected to lead by example, carefully modeling the love of Christ. Children develop at their own pace, and learn best through concrete experiences, active exploration, and play.</p>
        <p>Everything teaches: the classroom environment, and the relationships among children, adults, and the curriculum. Children learn best in a safe and secure environment, where they are respected and expected to respect their peers and teachers, and where guidance and discipline is just, loving, and consistent.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

